  "metaDescription": "Indonesian National Police state Listyo Sigit Prabowo cannot resign honorably due to ongoing treason and illegal surveillance criminal investigations.",
  "aiSummaryBullets": [
    "The Indonesian National Police clarified that former official Listyo Sigit Prabowo is ineligible to resign honorably due to pending criminal charges.",
    "Investigations into an alleged treason plot and illegal surveillance have expanded to include the involvement of a Bogor-owned enterprise employee.",
    "The suspect faces potential dishonorable discharge from the police force as authorities, under official instruction, continue to pursue the case."
  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "The Indonesian National Police have officially confirmed that Listyo Sigit Prabowo is prohibited from submitting a voluntary resignation while facing active criminal investigations. Legal experts and officials noted that his involvement in an alleged treason plot and unauthorized surveillance of the president disqualifies him from receiving an honorable discharge, regardless of his two decades of service. The situation has intensified as investigators probe the scope of the alleged conspiracy, which reportedly involves orchestrating large-scale protests and producing controversial apparel through subordinates. Reports indicate that an employee of a regional state-owned enterprise in Bogor was allegedly directed by a former police chief to produce garments linked to the subversive activities. The government has ordered thorough investigations by the police and the State Intelligence Agency to address the accusations surrounding these events, which have drawn both domestic and international attention.",
